{"id":"u-1d8e0fe6-0be6-4ec0-b1f8-1943ccfaf71e","src":"community","title":"The V-Taper Strength Hybrid","author":"evytheodoruas","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/Fclfxw-the-v-taper-strength-hybrid","desc":"A strength-anchored, aesthetic-focused PPL designed to expand your upper frame while maintaining real performance. This routine prioritizes side and rear delts, lat width, upper chest fullness, and arm development to create a powerful V-taper without sacrificing compound strength.\n\nUsing double progression on all major lifts, the program drives steady, sustainable overload while managing fatigue and joint stress. Core training emphasizes anti-extension and deep abdominal control to maintain a tight waist and strong brace for heavy lifts.\n\nThe goal isn’t just to get bigger — it’s to build visible structure:\nwider shoulders, thicker arms, fuller chest, tighter midsection.\n\nThis is a long-term physique phase built to grow intelligently, not recklessly.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":10,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-10-30T05:12:48.779Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["PUSH (Hyper)","PULL (Hyper)","LEGS (Hyper)","PUSH (Strength)","PULL (Strength)","LEGS (Strength)"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":3,"hi":5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"x":4}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":4}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"x":2}]},{"n":"Ab Wheel","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Lat Pulldown (Neutral Grip)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":4}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":4}]},{"n":"Reverse Pec Deck","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":20,"x":4}]},{"ss":[{"n":"One Arm Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":20,"hi":25,"x":3}]},